        random abilities planet:
            emotion sense:
                name:
                    - ...
                abilities:
                    - feeling and moving emotions (later also thoughts) of anything
                    conditions:
                        - sufficient physical contact
                            - spreads like voltage / high potential spreads more easily
                    scaling:
                        - stronger emotions / thoughts can already be felt through less
                        - larger contact surface, more focused concentration and more developed skill increase flow rate & sensitivity
                fate:
                    - meeting someone with remote aura for the first time
                        - finds out she can feel emotions by just being close
                            - example: handshake hasn't connected yet, pulls back in shock
                    - meeting someone with immense aura of negative emotions
                        - gets overwhelmed by just being within line of sight
            inherit:
                name:
                    - ...
                abilities:
                    - applies inheritance like in blender cad
                        - all parts of the target (child) inherit a given aspect of those parts of the source (parent)
                    conditions:
                        - must physically touch (or be within trained distance of) both parent & child at activation
                        - target mass does not exceed trained limit
                    growth:
                        - maximum range of activation
                        - maximum distance of keeping inheritance active
                        - maximum mass of applicable entities
                        - duration of effect
                fate:
                    - carries tools to best use ability
                    example moves:
                        - low level: shield inherits relative position to caster
                            - makes shield keep its location relative to the caster fixed, floating in front of him
                            - as all parts of the shield are affected, it will not even scratch when walking though walls with it
                        - mid level: enemy inherits relative position to part of the earth
                            - when that part of the earth (maybe a rock) gets lifted, the whole enemy lifts
                            - may be applied such that it only affects the average position of the enemy, so they may still fight back even though they cannot move their center of mass
                            - enemy will then float there like a wireless punching bag
                        - high level: enemy inherits relative temperature to a rock
                            - rock heats by 100°C when thrown into a furnace -> enemy heats up by 100°C, evenly
                        - catastrophic level: enemy inherits absolute temperature of liquid nitrogen (caster carries that with him just for that move)
                            - enemy immediately freezes and crumbles into pieces
                        - catastrophic level: planet inherits relative position to held rock
                            - moving the rock moves the entire planet and thus acts like an engine for the entire planet as a spaceship
            enchant:
                name:
                    - ...
                abilities:
                    - can apply various enchantments to physical items
                    conditions:
                        - physical touch
                    growth:
                        - maximum mass of enchanted object
                        - maximum size of enchanted object
                        - maximum range of activation and keeping the enchant active
                        - maximum duration of keeping the enchant active
                        - maximum intensity of enchant
                        - success rate of enchanting working
                fate:
                    example moves:
                        - apply to crown:
                            - curse of binding: passive effect - once worn, the item cannot be taken off of the wearers body until it breaks or the wearer dies
                            - thorns: active effect - once hit, will send the same hit back at the attacker
                            - friendly fire: passive effect - reverses all active effects (inverse-thorns: once-hit, will send the same hit at the victim again; may count as another hit on level 2)
                        - apply to sword:
                            - loyalty: returns to owner after losing physical contact
                            - sharpness: sharpens itself over time with speed according to level of enchant
                            - flame: anything touched will start burning at the points of contact
            ghost:
                name:
                    - King ...
                abilities:
                    - ghost: enables noclip for caster and touch (within trained range)
                    - soul eater: tries to absorb souls of anything the caster noclips through
                        - success - grows stronger, absorbs abilities of the soul
                        - failure - gets kicked out from the soul, never to try that one again (blocked from clipping soul owner)